@gw = http://localhost:5200

### G01 Admin token
# @name adminLogin
POST {{gw}}/v1/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "admin", "roles": ["Admin"] }

### G02 Customer token
# @name customerLogin
POST {{gw}}/v1/dev/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "asha", "roles": ["Customer"] }

### G10 Seed keyboard (Admin)
POST {{gw}}/v1/inventory
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "sku": "KB-001", "name": "Mechanical Keyboard", "quantity": 25, "price": 49.99 }

### G11 Seed mouse (Admin)
POST {{gw}}/v1/inventory
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "sku": "MS-002", "name": "Wireless Mouse", "quantity": 40, "price": 19.50 }

### G20 Place an order (Customer)
POST {{gw}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "customerName": "Asha Rao",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "KB-001", "quantity": 2 },
    { "sku": "MS-002", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### G21 Get the order (paste the id)
GET {{gw}}/v1/orders/533a532e-6a8c-4e20-a341-d9b654927dba

### G22 List orders
GET {{gw}}/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=10